From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:19:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3426/3799] soh: rename D_80130418 -> sUnusedAudioMatrix

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: an 8 by 8 s16 table in audio_data.c that nothing in the tree reads
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/audio_data.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/audio_data.c b/soh/src/code/audio_data.c
index 980b0a888..cf961a08a 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/audio_data.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/audio_data.c
@@ -665,7 +665,8 @@ s16 sHighPassFilterData[15 * 8] = {
     /* 0xE */ -772,  -3,    -6985, 17240, -6985, -3,    -772,  -3,
 };
 
-s16 D_80130418[8 * 8] = {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_80130418: an 8 by 8 s16 table in audio_data.c that nothing in the tree reads
+s16 sUnusedAudioMatrix[8 * 8] = {  // was D_80130418 [LLM:GUESS]
     /* 0x0 */ 0,      6392,   12539,  18204,  23169,  27244,  30272,  32137,
     /* 0x1 */ 32767,  32137,  30272,  27244,  23169,  18204,  12539,  6392,
     /* 0x2 */ 0,      -3211,  -6392,  -9511,  -12539, -15446, -18204, -20787,
